  "art_readout": "Joined rising quiet return, shaped seat/book edges, low open planted seat, supported portal terminal and distinct service/storage faces are legible in ordinary640\u00d7360 component and proposed-arrangement views. Material roles remain ivory primary, recessed teal, tactile timber and restrained metal joints.",
  "spatial_limits": [
    "New proposed adjustable component arrangement only; original ship and final guest polygon remain missing.",
    "Historical rectangular allocation, X48 architectural portal, X52/X98 moving-door locations and8.25m budget are archived claims. Later quiet authoring maximum7.2\u00d75.4\u00d73.8m governs this component; it does not recover a room.",
    "Actual public/service clear width/height, leaf stroke, cassette and head reservation remain unknown. Editable4.4\u00d73.1m opening contains no leaves.",
    "The quiet side/book cheek screens the proposed lateral seated look toward arrival. Forward and opposing bay-mouth views establish the useful relationship; no seated-atrium-view claim.",
    "Service return is a separate rear candidate with intervening host geometry/route unmodeled. No complete room, actor/cart route, universal species fit, guard compliance or structural load rating.",
    "Collision screens use finite clear/blocked controls and conservative compounds. Profile sampling records up to11.77mm crown clearance reduction,4.03mm cove intrusion and47.03mm intentional finish-channel filling. Shape counts and approximation limits are explicit; no exact sweep or runtime budget acceptance.",
    "Source-only runs executed by authors under lead coordination and independently scope/hash checked here; no duplicate build. Six regenerated GLBs match byte-for-byte.",
    "Complete archive/restore, remote push and durable user delivery remain separate lead gates."
  ]
